{"text":"He who lights the earth and those who dwell on it, with mercy and daily in His goodness constantly renews the work of creation.  "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"104"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/104/24","n":"24"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/104/24"}}
{"text":"How numerous are Thy works, O Lord, all of them hast Thou made with wisdom, the earth is full of Thy possessions. "}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"O King, who alone is exalted from of old, extolled and praised and glorified since days of antiquity. O God of eternity, in Thy great mercy have mercy upon us, "}
{"start":"t:pb","attrs":{"ed":"1965","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n104.jpg","n":"38"}}
{"end":"t:pb"}
{"tail":"Lord of our might, Rock of our fortress, shield of our salvation, a fortress around us. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
